config-connector-extensions patch 0041: mockgcp serves regional Compute Engine autoscalers.

mockcompute registered no RegionAutoscalers server, so every regional
autoscaler request was a 404 from the mux (found writing
ComputeRegionAutoscaler). Get, list, insert, patch (the fields set),
update (replace) and delete, as patch 0039 serves zonal ones: the target
regional group must exist, the target and region come back as full URLs,
and the policy's defaults are filled in (autoscalerDefaults, 0039).

